{"id":"n81570-1-7","stage":5,"title":"쾌활하다 · 快活","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81570-1-7-1","ko":"어머니, 며느릿감을 만나 보신 소감이 어떠세요?","zh":"妈妈，见了未来的儿媳妇，感觉怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니,","meaning":"妈妈，婆婆","explanation":"어머니：妈妈，婆婆。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"6","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}},{"text":"며느릿감을","meaning":"儿媳妇人选，未来儿媳妇","explanation":"며느릿감：儿媳妇人选，未来儿媳妇；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"며느릿감","audio":"/audio/cf4a8c6ddee9c25b4328.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55541","senseId":"1","lemma":"며느릿감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"며느릿감을","audio":"/audio/b1f679cc2b34466ce45a.mp3"}},{"text":"만나","meaning":"遇到","explanation":"만나다：遇到；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"9","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나","audio":"/audio/3fecb3f7ca424d687c50.mp3"}},{"text":"보신","meaning":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보신","audio":"/audio/cb24f5f4b61d3fe2e63b.mp3"}},{"text":"소감이","meaning":"感想","explanation":"소감：感想；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소감","audio":"/audio/a0e303ba81b3fd1b2496.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64299","senseId":"1","lemma":"소감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소감이","audio":"/audio/894d29a0809338cfbb05.mp3"}},{"text":"어떠세요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떠세요","audio":"/audio/408a5132a57148c800a4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"妈妈，婆婆","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于亲切地指称或称呼丈夫的母亲。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"cf4a8c6ddee9c25b","term":"며느릿감","zh":"儿媳妇人选，未来儿媳妇","audio":"/audio/cf4a8c6ddee9c25b4328.mp3","entryId":"55541","definition":"可以作为儿媳妇的女子。","pronunciation":["며느리깜","며느릳깜"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"遇到","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"因有缘而建立某种关系。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"a0e303ba81b3fd1b","term":"소감","zh":"感想","audio":"/audio/a0e303ba81b3fd1b2496.mp3","entryId":"64299","definition":"对某事的感觉或想法。","pronunciation":["소ː감"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f51cc1b3f27c79c6af0d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81570-1-7-2","ko":"첫인상이 참하고 성격도 쾌활해서 아주 마음에 들더구나.","zh":"第一印象端庄，性格也开朗，我很喜欢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"첫인상이","meaning":"第一印象","explanation":"첫인상：第一印象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"첫인상","audio":"/audio/cdab44c8c3a2de9e8a22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77846","senseId":"1","lemma":"첫인상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"첫인상이","audio":"/audio/fbd7ea6fdb3d83e43885.mp3"}},{"text":"참하고","meaning":"细心，文静 ，沉着","explanation":"참하다：细心，文静 ，沉着；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"참하다","audio":"/audio/8f61824588b19e256d67.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78758","senseId":"2","lemma":"참하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참하고","audio":"/audio/e7d991df1f34269ac4d8.mp3"}},{"text":"성격도","meaning":"性格","explanation":"성격：性格；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"성격","audio":"/audio/9b3edda555d03500b72a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62821","senseId":"1","lemma":"성격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"성격도","audio":"/audio/2e3067dc64826dd1ab7b.mp3"}},{"text":"쾌활해서","meaning":"快活，开朗，爽朗，明快","explanation":"쾌활하다：快活，开朗，爽朗，明快；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"쾌활하다","audio":"/audio/7dae578a4442f113f8da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81570","senseId":"1","lemma":"쾌활하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쾌활해서","audio":"/audio/d5e4efe8f3ff5b8229d4.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"마음에","meaning":"心意，心思","explanation":"마음：心意，心思；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"4","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마음에","audio":"/audio/43f69e9e8e24ba2d0d8c.mp3"}},{"text":"들더구나.","meaning":"中意，称心，看中","explanation":"들다：中意，称心，看中；더구나：回顾亲历的情况并表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"11","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들더구나","audio":"/audio/d79d31844d1f41ffbb0a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"cdab44c8c3a2de9e","term":"첫인상","zh":"第一印象","audio":"/audio/cdab44c8c3a2de9e8a22.mp3","entryId":"77846","definition":"第一次接触或交往后的所得的印象。","pronunciation":["처딘상"]},{"id":"8f61824588b19e25","term":"참하다","zh":"细心，文静 ，沉着","audio":"/audio/8f61824588b19e256d67.mp3","entryId":"78758","definition":"举止谨慎或性格沉稳。","pronunciation":["참ː하다"]},{"id":"9b3edda555d03500","term":"성격","zh":"性格","audio":"/audio/9b3edda555d03500b72a.mp3","entryId":"62821","definition":"个人具有的固有脾气或品性。","pronunciation":["성ː껵"]},{"id":"7dae578a4442f113","term":"쾌활하다","zh":"快活，开朗，爽朗，明快","audio":"/audio/7dae578a4442f113f8da.mp3","entryId":"81570","definition":"明朗而活泼。","pronunciation":["쾌활하다"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心意，心思","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"喜爱或关心的心情。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"中意，称心，看中","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"觉得某物好。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dd26b7a96aa0af2e5de4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.309,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81570","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":158,"sequenceScore":3.1357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["第一印象端庄，性格也开朗，我很喜欢。","这椅子稍微一碰就散架，怎么行？","妈妈，见了未来的儿媳妇，感觉怎么样？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["第一印象端庄，性格也开朗，我很喜欢。","妈妈，见了未来的儿媳妇，感觉怎么样？","这椅子稍微一碰就散架，怎么行？"],"answer":0}]}
